{"id":"6f41aace-2481-458e-8286-9062d152cb35","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"a20ab411bf9b4e1e","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/build/static-host.ts","baseline":{"blob":"ea54c3d794562566899cb04599cec4a118a64d60","start":0,"end":42},"shape":{"type":"ImportDeclaration","atoms":["import","type","{","Logger",",","Plugin","}","from","\"","vite","\""]},"context":{"after":"afed7145b7311ebb"}},"payload":{"text":"The editor on a plain static host: the service worker that gives it cross-origin isolation, serves package files\nfrom the CDN and answers previews (coi-serviceworker.js), built beside the site, and the files a host reads to serve\nthe site well.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:10:33.027Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:10:33.027Z"}
{"id":"7f42b3a4-8f55-41fc-9d96-7e17d8f1b7d6","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"a4682fe99ba38913","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/build/static-host.ts","baseline":{"blob":"57032bdca0be5b0fa1c559eaf53343edeed63db3","start":2089,"end":2365},"shape":{"type":"CallExpression","atoms":["this",".","emitFile","(","{","\"","type","\"",":","\"","asset","\"",",","\"","fileName","\"",":","\"","_headers","\"",",","\"","source","\"",":","[","\"","/*","\"",",","\"","  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin","\"",",","\"","  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: credentialless","\"",",","\"","  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'self'","\"",",","\"","  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff","\"",",","\"","","\"","]",".","join","(","\"","\\","\\n","n","\"",")","}",")"]},"context":{"before":"58d8c0ad285940e2","after":"9cc7e365550704c8"}},"payload":{"text":"frame-ancestors 'self': the shell is the editor's only embedder. Another site framing it could navigate the frames\ninside it, such as the DevTools frame the shell posts to with \"*\" (shell/preview-devtools.ts).","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:10:31.229Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:10:31.229Z"}
{"id":"82b6ce99-7425-4069-8ee7-be723e5b8977","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"81615dcf8e1d9f35","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/build/static-host.ts","baseline":{"blob":"f8630502985a49769c56b9188f67dbf4701dd680","start":1074,"end":2077},"shape":{"type":"ExportDeclaration","atoms":["export","function","staticHostPlugin","(",")",":","Plugin","{","return","{","\"","name","\"",":","\"","static-host","\"",",","\"","enforce","\"",":","\"","post","\"",",","\"","generateBundle","\"",":","function","(","_options",",","bundle",")","{","const","index","=","bundle","[","\"","index.html","\"","]",";","if","(","index","?.","type","===","\"","asset","\"",")","{","this",".","emitFile","(","{","\"","type","\"",":","\"","asset","\"",",","\"","fileName","\"",":","\"","404.html","\"",",","\"","source","\"",":","index",".","source","}",")",";","}","this",".","emitFile","(","{","\"","type","\"",":","\"","asset","\"",",","\"","fileName","\"",":","\"","_headers","\"",",","\"","source","\"",":","[","\"","/*","\"",",","\"","  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin","\"",",","\"","  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: credentialless","\"",",","\"","  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'self'","\"",",","\"","  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff","\"",",","\"","","\"","]",".","join","(","\"","\\","\\n","n","\"",")","}",")",";","this",".","emitFile","(","{","\"","type","\"",":","\"","asset","\"",",","\"","fileName","\"",":","\"","_redirects","\"",",","\"","source","\"",":","[","\"","/ /index.html 200","\"",",","\"","/env/:owner/:repo /index.html 200","\"",",","\"","/env/:owner/:repo/ /index.html 200","\"",",","\"","","\"","]",".","join","(","\"","\\","\\n","n","\"",")","}",")",";","this",".","emitFile","(","{","\"","type","\"",":","\"","asset","\"",",","\"","fileName","\"",":","\"",".assetsignore","\"",",","\"","source","\"",":","\"","packages/\\n*.map\\n","\\","n","\\","n","\"","}",")",";","this",".","emitFile","(","{","\"","type","\"",":","\"","asset","\"",",","\"","fileName","\"",":","\"","robots.txt","\"",",","\"","source","\"",":","\"","User-agent: *\\nDisallow: /\\n","\\","n","\\","n","\"","}",")",";","}","}",";","}"]},"context":{"before":"cdb8d4331fcedbe1"}},"payload":{"text":"What a static host needs to serve the site well, beside it. The production site (packages/site/editor.jsonc, Workers\nstatic assets) reads `_headers` — real cross-origin isolation headers, so the first load needn't wait for the service\nworker to stamp them — `_redirects`, which serves the editor's page at every `env/<owner>/<repo>` (shell/address.ts), and\n`.assetsignore`: the package tarballs are the releases' and Pages', not the site's, and source maps are kept apart; and\n`robots.txt`, turning crawlers away. GitHub Pages reads none of them;\nthere `404.html` is the editor's page, so a deep link opens the editor (with a 404 status, which the page doesn't mind).","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:10:31.727Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:10:31.727Z"}
{"id":"85f54b2e-835c-4851-b554-757e8c80df77","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"3532e7c0df7518dc","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/build/static-host.ts","baseline":{"blob":"a6e802c496755fc6f1df2d90a0b630f1f959b307","start":515,"end":587},"shape":{"type":"VariableDeclaration","atoms":["const","{","buildPackage","}","=","await","import","(","\"","@brianjenkins94/util/vite/build","\"",")"]},"context":{"before":"afcf79d5f4c450d9","after":"e3e2e52334250f2b"}},"payload":{"text":"(Vite loaded here, when it builds: the module's other exports, the plugin static-host.test checks, don't need it)","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:10:32.161Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:10:32.161Z"}
{"id":"ad7d7352-b04d-4f74-8e73-f4e117c1c9b6","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"6f2298123e867264","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/build/static-host.ts","baseline":{"blob":"f48c02661b6e9e71b04bf5793c1c96b2b392b420","start":3067,"end":3169},"shape":{"type":"CallExpression","atoms":["this",".","emitFile","(","{","\"","type","\"",":","\"","asset","\"",",","\"","fileName","\"",":","\"","robots.txt","\"",",","\"","source","\"",":","\"","User-agent: *\\nDisallow: /\\n","\\","n","\\","n","\"","}",")"]},"context":{"before":"d246fec9d7eabf5a"}},"payload":{"text":"Crawlers that ask are sent to the root domain, which asks them to pay (packages/site/src/gate.ts); the editor stays\nstatic files with no Worker in front, so it can't. Pages serves this at /editor/robots.txt, where nobody looks.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:10:30.351Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:10:30.351Z"}
{"id":"c81ca55a-4661-4a21-a382-914359330969","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"9cc7e365550704c8","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/build/static-host.ts","baseline":{"blob":"0f153f961d65e5e73cbd45530be21d6cdb11baee","start":2592,"end":2775},"shape":{"type":"CallExpression","atoms":["this",".","emitFile","(","{","\"","type","\"",":","\"","asset","\"",",","\"","fileName","\"",":","\"","_redirects","\"",",","\"","source","\"",":","[","\"","/ /index.html 200","\"",",","\"","/env/:owner/:repo /index.html 200","\"",",","\"","/env/:owner/:repo/ /index.html 200","\"",",","\"","","\"","]",".","join","(","\"","\\","\\n","n","\"",")","}",")"]},"context":{"before":"a4682fe99ba38913","after":"d246fec9d7eabf5a"}},"payload":{"text":"html_handling is \"none\" (editor.jsonc: no 307 from `x.html` to `x`), so the root names index.html itself. Named\nplaceholders, not `/env/*`: a splat rewrite 404s under \"none\".","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:10:30.787Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:10:30.787Z"}
